{"id":"n90906-1-9","stage":4,"title":"동정 · 同情","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90906-1-9-1","ko":"어제 뉴스 봤어? 사고를 당한 사람 정말 안됐더라.","zh":"昨天看新闻了吗？出事故的那个人真是太可怜了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뉴스","meaning":"新闻，新事件","explanation":"뉴스：新闻，新事件","readings":[{"term":"뉴스","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32795","senseId":"2","lemma":"뉴스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤어?","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사고를","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당한","meaning":"遭遇，遭受","explanation":"당하다：遭遇，遭受；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"당하다","audio":"/audio/9c2599f3570a2b0ad6c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14730","senseId":"5","lemma":"당하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人","explanation":"사람：人","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"1","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안됐더라.","meaning":"心疼，不忍","explanation":"안되다：心疼，不忍；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"안되다","audio":"/audio/988ac8e2982c41f4e0c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16005","senseId":"1","lemma":"안되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"5ac661dbed5720ae","term":"뉴스","zh":"新闻，新事件","audio":"/audio/5ac661dbed5720aed8f4.mp3","entryId":"32795","definition":"初次被公开的新消息。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"意料之外发生的不好的事情。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"9c2599f3570a2b0a","term":"당하다","zh":"遭遇，遭受","audio":"/audio/9c2599f3570a2b0ad6c8.mp3","entryId":"14730","definition":"经历不好的事情。","pronunciation":["당하다"]},{"id":"389e7564ae2551b4","term":"사람","zh":"人","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3","entryId":"58161","definition":"可以思考，会制造并使用语言和工具、构成社会而生活的存在。","pronunciation":["사ː람"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"988ac8e2982c41f4","term":"안되다","zh":"心疼，不忍","audio":"/audio/988ac8e2982c41f4e0c8.mp3","entryId":"16005","definition":"因不幸或可怜而心里难受。","pronunciation":["안되다","안뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/ac12dc5794771faa4c01.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90906-1-9-2","ko":"응. 나도 그 상황에 정말 동정이 갔어.","zh":"嗯，我对那种情况也深感同情。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상황에","meaning":"状况，情况","explanation":"상황：状况，情况；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"상황","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16582","senseId":"1","lemma":"상황","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"동정이","meaning":"同情，怜悯","explanation":"동정：同情，怜悯；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"동정","audio":"/audio/079c7beb0df73f91287f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90906","senseId":"1","lemma":"동정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"갔어.","meaning":"产生","explanation":"가다：产生；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"4","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"946f8147acaaf499","term":"상황","zh":"状况，情况","audio":"/audio/946f8147acaaf499e924.mp3","entryId":"16582","definition":"事情进行的景况或态势。","pronunciation":["상황"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"079c7beb0df73f91","term":"동정","zh":"同情，怜悯","audio":"/audio/079c7beb0df73f91287f.mp3","entryId":"90906","definition":"像自己的事一样对待别人的困难处境并怜惜。","pronunciation":["동정"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"产生","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"关心或视线被某个对象吸引。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/72af5dfa3f21a4717744.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.947,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90906","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":141,"sequenceScore":2.7737,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["昨天看新闻了吗？出事故的那个人真是太可怜了。","嗯，我对那种情况也深感同情。","请尝尝炸虾吧。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["昨天看新闻了吗？出事故的那个人真是太可怜了。","嗯，我对那种情况也深感同情。","请尝尝炸虾吧。"],"answer":1}]}
